 [90, 60684], [95, 60944]]}, {"verse": 9, "start": 62282, "end": 71244, "text": "And as they came down from the mountain, he charged them that they should tell no man what things they had seen, till the Son of man were risen from the dead.", "words": [[0, 62282], [4, 62415], [7, 62615], [12, 62755], [17, 63015], [22, 63335], [27, 63575], [31, 63755], [41, 64355], [44, 64595], [52, 65055], [57, 65355], [62, 65555], [67, 65695], [74, 65875], [79, 66135], [82, 66395], [86, 66695], [91, 66995], [98, 67375], [103, 67575], [107, 67735], [113, 68666], [118, 68946], [122, 69126], [126, 69346], [129, 69466], [133, 69746], [138, 69986], [144, 70286], [149, 70566], [153, 70726]]}, {"verse": 10, "start": 71694, "end": 77749, "text": "And they kept that saying with themselves, questioning one with another what the rising from the dead should mean.", "words": [[0, 71694], [4, 71842], [9, 71942], [14, 72242], [19, 72482], [26, 72842], [31, 73082], [43, 74022], [55, 74522], [59, 74902], [64, 75202], [72, 75542], [77, 75842], [81, 75982], [88, 76362], [93, 76642], [97, 76782], [102, 77022], [109, 77222]]}, {"verse": 11, "start": 78199, "end": 82669, "text": "¶ And they asked him, saying, Why say the scribes that Elias must first come?", "words": [[2, 78199], [6, 78324], [11, 78444], [17, 78724], [22, 79024], [30, 80140], [34, 80318], [38, 80598], [42, 80758], [50, 81258], [55, 81378], [61, 81758], [66, 81918], [72, 82178]]}, {"verse": 12, "start": 83019, "end": 93943, "text": "And he answered and told them, Elias indeed comes first, and restores all things; and how it is written of the Son of man, that he must suffer many things, and be treated with contempt.", "words": [[0, 83019], [4, 83155], [7, 83275], [16, 83675], [20, 83895], [25, 84095], [31, 84775], [37, 85324], [44, 85544], [50, 85944], [57, 86304], [61, 86924], [70, 87424], [74, 87624], [82, 88488], [86, 88612], [90, 88812], [93, 88952], [96, 89072], [104, 89312], [107, 89492], [111, 89612], [115, 89832], [118, 89952], [123, 90292], [128, 90732], [131, 90872], [136, 91032], [143, 91352], [148, 91672], [156, 92092], [160, 92592], [163, 92732], [171, 93052], [176, 93292]]}, {"verse": 13, "start": 94393, "end": 100454, "text": "But I say to you, That Elias is indeed come, and they have done to him whatever they wanted, as it is written of him.", "words": [[0, 94393], [4, 94551], [6, 94691], [10, 94891], [13, 95071], [18, 95251], [23, 95491], [29, 95911], [32, 96071], [39, 96391], [45, 97171], [49, 97351], [54, 97471], [59, 97631], [64, 97831], [67, 98011], [71, 98171], [80, 98411], [85, 98691], [93, 99291], [96, 99491], [99, 99631], [102, 99731], [110, 99951], [113, 100151]]}, {"verse": 14, "start": 100804, "end": 107106, "text": "¶ And when he came to his disciples, he saw a great multitude about them, and the scribes questioning with them.", "words": [[2, 100804], [6, 100937], [11, 101097], [14, 101217], [19, 101457], [22, 101657], [26, 101817], [37, 102837], [40, 102997], [44, 103257], [46, 103457], [52, 103737], [62, 104277], [68, 104657], [74, 104957], [78, 105377], [82, 105517], [90, 105997], [102, 106417], [107, 106737]]}, {"verse": 15, "start": 107556, "end": 112937, "text": "And immediately all the people, when they beheld him, were greatly amazed, and running to him saluted him.", "words": [[0, 107556], [4, 107702], [16, 108002], [20, 108482], [24, 108642], [32, 108962], [37, 109242], [42, 109382], [49, 109762], [54, 109962], [59, 110222], [67, 110562], [75, 111042], [79, 111462], [87, 111702], [90, 111922], [94, 112062], [102, 112542]]}, {"verse": 16, "start": 113387, "end": 116224, "text": "And he asked the scribes, What do you question with them?", "words": [[0, 113387], [4, 113508], [7, 113628], [13, 113848], [17, 114048], [26, 114951], [31, 115095], [34, 115215], [38, 115295], [47, 115595], [52, 115896]]}, {"verse": 17, "start": 116574, "end": 122249, "text": "And one of the multitude answered and said, Master, I have brought to you my son, which has a dumb spirit;", "words": [[0, 116574], [4, 116698], [8, 116878], [11, 117018], [15, 117118], [25, 117498], [34, 117978], [38, 118278], [44, 119030], [52, 119318], [54, 119498], [59, 119598], [67, 119778], [70, 119958], [74, 120018], [77, 120178], [82, 120858], [88, 121038], [92, 121278], [94, 121398], [99, 121598]]}, {"verse": 18, "start": 122699, "end": 132704, "text": "And wherever he takes him, he tears him: and he foams, and gnashes with his teeth, and pines away: and I spoke to your disciples that they should cast him out; and they could not.", "words": [[0, 122699], [4, 122823], [13, 123123], [16, 123363], [22, 123643], [27, 124083], [30, 124183], [36, 124463], [41, 125179], [45, 125298], [48, 125528], [55, 125758], [59, 126218], [67, 126558], [72, 126798], [76, 126918], [83, 127198], [87, 127498], [93, 127838], [99, 128554], [103, 128672], [105, 128892], [111, 129172], [114, 129412], [119, 129532], [129, 130072], [134, 130412], [139, 130572], [146, 130732], [151, 131092], [155, 131292], [160, 132001], [164, 132122], [169, 132222], [175, 132402]]}, {"verse": 19, "start": 133054, "end": 140837, "text": "He answers him, and says, O faithless generation, how long shall I be with you? how long shall I bear with you? bring him to me.", "words": [[0, 133054], [3, 133181], [11, 133481], [16, 133801], [20, 133961], [26, 134707], [28, 134887], [38, 135467], [50, 136327], [54, 136447], [59, 136747], [65, 136987], [67, 137107], [70, 137287], [75, 137507], [80, 138128], [84, 138246], [89, 138466], [95, 138686], [97, 138826], [102, 139046], [107, 139266], [112, 139908], [118, 140091], [122, 140291], [125, 140451]]}, {"verse": 20, "start": 141187, "end": 148526, "text": "And they brought him to him: and when he saw him, immediately the spirit convulsed him; and he fell on the ground, and wallowed foaming.", "words": [[0, 141187], [4, 141328], [9, 141428], [17, 141688], [21, 141888], [24, 142088], [29, 142772], [33, 142917], [38, 143057], [41, 143237], [45, 143517], [50, 143817], [62, 144177], [66, 144617], [73, 144937], [83, 145577], [88, 146111], [92, 146253], [95, 146353], [100, 146573], [103, 146753], [107, 146873], [115, 147173], [119, 147513], [128, 147933]]}, {"verse": 21, "start": 148976, "end": 160902, "text": "And he asked his father, How long is it ago since this came to him? And he said, Of a child.", "words": [[0, 148976], [4, 149133], [7, 149253], [13, 149533], [17, 149733], [25, 150570], [29, 150732], [34, 151032], [37, 151232], [40, 151332], [44, 151612], [50, 151992], [55, 152292], [60, 152572], [63, 152792], [66, 156168], [68, 157709], [72, 157853], [75, 157993], [81, 160114], [84, 160267], [86, 160347]]}, {"verse": 22, "start": 161352, "end": 169106, "text": "And often it has cast him into the fire, and into the waters, to destroy him: but if you can do any thing, have compassion on us, and help us.", "words": [[0, 161352], [4, 161475], [10, 161695], [13, 161895], [17, 162055], [22, 162295], [26, 162535], [31, 162715], [35, 162875], [41, 163215], [45, 163695], [50, 163895], [54, 164055], [62, 164355], [65, 164655], [73, 165095], [78, 165816], [82, 165901], [85, 166041], [89, 166161], [93, 166321], [96, 166634], [100, 166948], [107, 167261], [112, 167361], [123, 167801], [126, 168081], [130, 168261], [134, 168461], [139, 168701]]}, {"verse": 23, "start": 169456, "end": 177311, "text": "Jesus said to him, If you can believe, all things are possible to him that believes.", "words": [[0, 169456], [6, 169796], [11, 170116], [14, 170316], [19, 173298], [22, 173484], [26, 173624], [30, 173784], [39, 174724], [43, 174944], [50, 175284], [54, 175524], [63, 175964], [66, 176204], [70, 176424], [75, 176644]]}, {"verse": 24, "start": 177661, "end": 184437, "text": "And immediately the father of the child cried out, and said with tears, Lord, I believe; help my unbelief.", "words": [[0, 177661], [4, 177791], [16, 178151], [20, 178591], [27, 178911], [30, 179151], [34, 179271], [40, 179651], [46, 179971], [51, 180291], [55, 180691], [60, 180971], [65, 181191], [72, 182118], [78, 182482], [80, 182502], [89, 183374], [94, 183557], [97, 183777]]}, {"verse": 25, "start": 184787, "end": 195977, "text": "When Jesus saw that the people came running together, he rebuked the foul spirit, saying to him, You dumb and deaf spirit, I charge you, come out of him, and enter no more into him.", "words": [[0, 184787], [5, 184913], [11, 185193], [15, 185673], [20, 185853], [24, 185993], [31, 186273], [36, 186533], [44, 186833], [54, 187773], [57, 187873], [65, 188413], [69, 188533], [74, 188813], [82, 189553], [89, 189753], [92, 189973], [97, 190551], [101, 190717], [106, 191137], [110, 191397], [115, 191717], [123, 192457], [125, 192637], [132, 192977], [137, 193537], [142, 193677], [146, 193897], [149, 194017], [154, 194457], [158, 194577], [164, 194837], [167, 195037], [172, 195297], [177, 195577]]}, {"verse": 26, "start": 196327, "end": 206224, "text": "And the spirit cried, and convulsed him greatly, and came out of him: and he was as one dead; so that many said, He is dead.", "words": [[0, 196327], [4, 196481], [8, 196581], [15, 196981], [22, 197541], [26, 198181], [36, 198841], [40, 198941], [49, 199381], [53, 200001], [58, 200261], [62, 200501], [65, 200661], [70, 201229], [74, 201393], [77, 201573], [81, 201813], [84, 202033], [88, 202353], [94, 203251], [97, 203436], [102, 203656], [107, 203916], [113, 205402], [116, 205631], [119, 205831]]}, {"verse": 27, "start": 206574, "end": 210749, "text": "But Jesus took him by the hand, and lifted him up; and he arose.", "words": [[0, 206574], [4, 206675], [10, 206975], [15, 207375], [19, 207535], [22, 207735], [26, 207875], [32, 208235], [36, 208495], [43, 208835], [47, 209075], [51, 209758], [55, 209904], [58, 210064]]}, {"verse": 28, "start": 211199, "end": 217432, "text": "And when he was come into the house, his disciples asked him privately, Why could not we cast him out?", "words": [[0, 211199], [4, 211320], [9, 211480], [12, 211640], [16, 211800], [21, 212040], [26, 212300], [30, 212460], [37, 213160], [41, 213320], [51, 213880], [57, 214320], [61, 214540], [72, 215638], [76, 215813], [82, 216033], [86, 216253], [89, 216493], [94, 216773], [98, 217013]]}, {"verse": 29, "start": 217782, "end": 223294, "text": "And he said to them, This kind can come forth by nothing, but by prayer and fasting.", "words": [[0, 217782], [4, 217913], [7, 218033], [12, 218273], [15, 218473], [21, 219068], [26, 219274], [31, 219594], [35, 219814], [40, 220054], [46, 220314], [49, 220554], [58, 221354], [62, 221634], [65, 221814], [72, 222314], [76, 222614]]}, {"verse": 30, "start": 223644, "end": 229311, "text": "¶ And they departed from there, and passed through Galilee; and he would not that any man should know it.", "words": [[2, 223644], [6, 223799], [11, 223899], [20, 224319], [25, 224639], [32, 224999], [36, 225479], [43, 225779], [51, 226059], [60, 227120], [64, 227265], [67, 227385], [73, 227525], [77, 227745], [82, 227965], [86, 228225], [90, 228505], [97, 228745], [102, 229025]]}, {"verse": 31, "start": 229761, "end": 239971, "text": "For he taught his disciples, and said to them, The Son of man is delivered into the hands of men, and they shall kill him; and after that he is killed, he shall rise the third day.", "words": [[0, 229761], [4, 229862], [7, 230022], [14, 230222], [18, 230422], [29, 230962], [33, 231242], [38, 231442], [41, 231642], [47, 232203], [51, 232282], [55, 232542], [58, 232662], [62, 232982], [65, 233182], [75, 233502], [80, 233862], [84, 234042], [90, 234302], [93, 234482], [98, 235042], [102, 235282], [107, 235442], [113, 235682], [118, 235962], [123, 236660], [127, 236781], [133, 237081], [138, 237321], [141, 237541], [144, 237681], [152, 238261], [155, 238361], [161, 238581], [166, 238981], [170, 239221], [176, 239481]]}, {"verse": 32, "start": 240321, "end": 244361, "text": "But they understood not that saying, and were afraid to ask him.", "words": [[0, 240321], [4, 240472], [9, 240652], [20, 241192], [24, 241532], [29, 241772], [37, 242192], [41, 242952], [46, 243172], [53, 243492], [56, 243712], [60, 243992]]}, {"verse": 33, "start": 244811, "end": 252028, "text": "¶ And he came to Capernaum: and being in the house he asked them, What was it that you disputed among yourselves by the way?", "words": [[2, 244811], [6, 244957], [9, 245077], [14, 245337], [17, 245875], [28, 246641], [32, 246785], [38, 247025], [41, 247225], [45, 247345], [51, 247565], [54, 247805], [60, 248085], [66, 248783], [71, 248965], [75, 249265], [78, 249465], [83, 249665], [87, 249845], [96, 250485], [102, 250665], [113, 251385], [116, 251525], [120, 251665]]}, {"verse": 34, "start": 252378, "end": 257958, "text": "But they kept silent: for by the way they had disputed among themselves, who should be the greatest.", "words": [[0, 252378], [4, 252486], [9, 252626], [14, 252866], [22, 253863], [26, 253979], [29, 254159], [33, 254299], [37, 254479], [42, 254679], [46, 254839], [55, 255479], [61, 255639], [73, 256259], [77, 256799], [84, 256979], [87, 257159], [91, 257279]]}, {"verse": 35, "start": 258408, "end": 266854, "text": "And he sat down, and called the twelve, and says to them, If any man desire to be first, the same shall be last of all, and servant of all.", "words": [[0, 258408], [4, 258532], [7, 258652], [11, 258912], [17, 259312], [21, 259632], [28, 259912], [32, 260092], [40, 260412], [44, 260712], [49, 260932], [52, 261172], [58, 261760], [61, 261898], [65, 262058], [69, 262338], [76, 262718], [79, 262998], [82, 263138], [89, 264018], [93, 264158], [98, 264418], [104, 264638], [107, 264758], [112, 265058], [115, 265238], [120, 265858], [124, 265938], [132, 266258], [135, 266518]]}, {"verse": 36, "start": 267204, "end": 273061, "text": "And he took a child, and set him in the midst of them: and when he had taken him in his arms, he said to them,", "words": [[0, 267204], [4, 267341], [7, 267441], [12, 267601], [14, 267741], [21, 268141], [25, 268681], [29, 268921], [33, 269121], [36, 269261], [40, 269341], [46, 269581], [49, 269801], [55, 270425], [59, 270568], [64, 270708], [67, 270888], [71, 270988], [77, 271268], [81, 271468], [84, 271628], [88, 271768], [94, 272248], [97, 272328], [102, 272528], [105, 272708]]}, {"verse": 37, "start": 273311, "end": 281629, "text": "Whoever shall receive one of such children in my name, receives me: and whoever shall receive me, receives not me, but him that sent me.", "words": [[0, 273311], [8, 273479], [14, 273859], [22, 274279], [26, 274539], [29, 274639], [34, 274879], [43, 275299], [46, 275459], [49, 275679], [55, 276259], [64, 276599], [68, 277354], [72, 277494], [80, 277714], [86, 278094], [94, 278514], [98, 279014], [107, 279314], [111, 279654], [115, 280194], [119, 280374], [123, 280654], [128, 281014], [133, 281254]]}, {"verse": 38, "start": 281979, "end": 291847, "text": "¶ And John answered him, saying, Master, we saw one casting out demons in your name, and he follows not us: and we forbade him, because he follows not us.", "words": [[2, 281979], [6, 282130], [11, 282370], [20, 282750], [25, 283070], [33, 285036], [41, 285322], [44, 285562], [48, 285762], [52, 285982], [60, 286362], [64, 286562], [71, 286882], [74, 287162], [79, 287302], [85, 287922], [89, 288022], [92, 288102], [100, 288322], [104, 288622], [108, 289388], [112, 289508], [115, 289608], [123, 290088], [128, 290268], [136, 290648], [139, 290868], [147, 291108], [151, 291428]]}, {"verse": 39, "start": 292197, "end": 300235, "text": "But Jesus said, Forbid him not: for there is no man which shall do a miracle in my name, that can lightly speak evil of me.", "words": [[0, 292197], [4, 292306], [10, 292606], [16, 293466], [23, 293966], [27, 294106], [32, 295004], [36, 295096], [42, 295276], [45, 295456], [48, 295676], [52, 296016], [58, 296256], [64, 296456], [67, 296656], [69, 296756], [77, 297156], [80, 297356], [83, 297576], [89, 297936], [94, 298376], [98, 298576], [106, 298876], [112, 299276], [117, 299656], [120, 299876]]}, {"verse": 40, "start": 300685, "end": 303225, "text": "For he that is not against us is on our part.", "words": [[0, 300685], [4, 300790], [7, 301010], [12, 301190], [15, 301350], [19, 301510], [27, 301790], [30, 302130], [33, 302330], [36, 302510], [40, 302670]]}, {"verse": 41, "start": 303675, "end": 311826, "text": "For whoever shall give you a cup of water to drink in my name, because you belong to Christ, indeed I say to you, he shall not lose his reward.", "words": [[0, 303675], [4, 303806], [12, 304046], [18, 304426], [23, 304686], [27, 304846], [29, 304966], [33, 305166], [36, 305326], [42, 305626], [45, 305806], [51, 306086], [54, 306226], [57, 306426], [63, 306886], [71, 307106], [75, 307346], [82, 307646], [85, 307866], [93, 308746], [100, 309206], [102, 309406], [106, 309606], [109, 309786], [114, 310166], [117, 310286], [123, 310526], [127, 310706], [132, 310986], [136, 311206]]}, {"verse": 42, "start": 312276, "end": 320718, "text": "And whoever shall offend one of these little ones that believe in me, it is better for him that a millstone were hanged about his neck, and he were cast into the sea.", "words": [[0, 312276], [4, 312401], [12, 312701], [18, 313041], [25, 313421], [29, 313681], [32, 313821], [38, 314001], [45, 314321], [50, 314621], [55, 314861], [63, 315181], [66, 315381], [70, 316081], [73, 316181], [76, 316301], [83, 316501], [87, 316721], [91, 316901], [96, 317081], [98, 317181], [108, 317621], [113, 317841], [120, 318161], [126, 318281], [130, 318501], [136, 319234], [140, 319358], [143, 319438], [148, 319538], [153, 319798], [158, 320098], [162, 320258]]}, {"verse": 43, "start": 321168, "end": 330199, "text": "And if your hand offend you, cut it off: it is better for you to enter into life maimed, than having two hands to go into hell, into the fire that never shall be quenched:", "words": [[0, 321168], [4, 321309], [7, 321449], [12, 321569], [17, 321899], [24, 322229], [29, 322669], [33, 322809], [36, 322949], [41, 323734], [44, 323831], [47, 323931], [54, 324151], [58, 324351], [62, 324471], [65, 324571], [71, 324831], [76, 325051], [81, 325351], [89, 325871], [94, 326231], [101, 326471], [105, 326751], [111, 327091], [114, 327291], [117, 327431], [122, 327591], [128, 328191], [133, 328371], [137, 328551], [142, 328851], [147, 329071], [153, 329291], [159, 329531], [162, 329651]]}, {"verse": 44, "start": 330649, "end": 334155, "text": "Where their worm dies not, and the fire is not quenched.", "words": [[0, 330649], [6, 330786], [12, 330986], [17, 331346], [22, 331686], [27, 332366], [31, 332666], [35, 332786], [40, 333106], [43, 333346], [47, 333526]]}, {"verse": 45, "start": 334605, "end": 343530, "text": "And if your foot offend you, cut it off: it is better for you to enter lame into life, than having two feet to be cast into hell, into the fire that never shall be quenched:", "words": [[0, 334605], [4, 334707], [7, 334847], [12, 334947], [17, 335237], [24, 335527], [29, 335907], [33, 336047], [36, 336187], [41, 336753], [44, 336859], [47, 336959], [54, 337179], [58, 337379], [62, 337499], [65, 337559], [71, 337839], [76, 338139], [81, 338359], [87, 338759], [92, 339219], [99, 339479], [103, 339739], [108, 340039], [111, 340219], [114, 340359], [119, 340559], [124, 340859], [130, 341519], [135, 341699], [139, 341859], [144, 342139], [149, 342319], [155, 342559], [161, 342819], [164, 342939]]}, {"verse": 46, "start": 343980, "end": 347576, "text": "Where their worm dies not, and the fire is not quenched.", "words": [[0, 343980], [6, 344174], [12, 344374], [17, 344734], [22, 345074], [27, 345894], [31, 346074], [35, 346174], [40, 346494], [43, 346714], [47, 346894]]}, {"verse": 47, "start": 348026, "end": 356670, "text": "And if your eye offend you, pluck it out: it is better for you to enter into the kingdom of God with one eye, than having two eyes to be cast into hell fire:", "words": [[0, 348026], [4, 348130], [7, 348270], [12, 348390], [16, 348670], [23, 348990], [28, 349650], [34, 349770], [37, 349930], [42, 350630], [45, 350716], [48, 350836], [55, 351056], [59, 351256], [63, 351376], [66, 351496], [72, 351756], [77, 351976], [81, 352136], [89, 352396], [92, 352636], [96, 352956], [101, 353196], [105, 353416], [110, 353796], [115, 354296], [122, 354536], [126, 354776], [131, 355096], [134, 355276], [137, 355376], [142, 355636], [147, 355996], [152, 356356]]}, {"verse": 48, "start": 357120, "end": 360465, "text": "Where their worm dies not, and the fire is not quenched.", "words": [[0, 357120], [6, 357240], [12, 357400], [17, 357720], [22, 358040], [27, 358840], [31, 359040], [35, 359160], [40, 359440], [43, 359620], [47, 359800]]}, {"verse": 49, "start": 360915, "end": 365777, "text": "For every one shall be salted with fire, and every sacrifice shall be salted with salt.", "words": [[0, 360915], [4, 361044], [10, 361324], [14, 361584], [20, 361764], [23, 361924], [30, 362284], [35, 362524], [41, 363104], [45, 363384], [51, 363644], [61, 364184], [67, 364564], [70, 364684], [77, 365044], [82, 365284]]}, {"verse": 50, "start": 366227, "end": 374955, "text": "Salt is good: but if the salt have lost his saltness, with what will you season it? Have salt in yourselves, and have peace one with another.", "words": [[0, 366227], [5, 366534], [8, 366834], [14, 367646], [18, 367804], [21, 367924], [25, 368064], [30, 368344], [35, 368544], [40, 368904], [44, 369394], [54, 369884], [59, 370224], [64, 370464], [69, 370604], [73, 370744], [80, 371024], [84, 371713], [89, 371875], [94, 372175], [97, 372375], [109, 372835], [113, 373435], [118, 373595], [124, 373935], [128, 374235], [133, 374435]]}]}